@startuml

actor Picker as P
participant "Warehouse Management System (WMS)" as S

P -> S: Request optimized picking route generation
S -> S: Retrieve picking plan from USEI03
S -> S: Merge duplicate bay entries (sum quantities)
S -> S: Apply Strategy A (Deterministic Sweep)
S -> S: Calculate total distance (using distance function D)
S -> S: Apply Strategy B (Nearest-Neighbour)
S -> S: Calculate total distance for Strategy B
S -> P: Return both routes and total distances\nfor each strategy

@enduml

